flowchart TD
 A[Agent proposes tool + arguments] --> S[Resolve registered tool schema]
 S --> V{Strict schema valid?}
 V -->|No| X[Reject + audit]
 V -->|Yes| I[Trusted identity + tenant authorization]
 I --> Q{Scope/resource allowed?}
 Q -->|No| X
 Q -->|Yes| R[Token bucket + bulkhead + deadline]
 R -->|Quota denied| D[Rate limited response]
 R -->|Admitted| K[Idempotency reserve + payload hash]
 K -->|Succeeded replay| O[Return cached result]
 K -->|Pending/unknown| C[Reconcile by provider key]
 K -->|New operation| B[Circuit breaker]
 B -->|OPEN| F[Fail fast / fallback]
 B -->|CLOSED/HALF_OPEN| P[Bounded provider call + retry]
 P --> Z[Validate response schema]
 Z --> L[Persist result + audit/outbox]
 L --> O
 C --> L
